{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STACK\u2019EM! is a tactical deckbuilder with a toybox twist: instead of shuffling cards, you stack body parts to build your own creatures out of cardboard, glue, and imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/2b7320210fb3c84e0d7894668c19afe5.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/2b7320210fb3c84e0d7894668c19afe5.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every arm, leg, head, or item you clip onto your stack changes its stats, abilities, and personality. The deeper the build, the stronger the creature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/bc96936a2ec2535a9530667b66f4e48c.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/bc96936a2ec2535a9530667b66f4e48c.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/bc96936a2ec2535a9530667b66f4e48c.mp4?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In STACK\u2019EM! there's no draw pile, no randomness. You always have your full deck in hand, and the only limit is your supply of clips, the resource you spend to stack\u2026 or unstack. Every decision matters, every turn is yours to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/e224b4cf201874b06fd8e6830e9f353b.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/e224b4cf201874b06fd8e6830e9f353b.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across the living room carpet against your friend\u2019s \u201cfactory-perfect\u201d toy creations: plastic mechas, porcelain dolls, plushies that bite back, and action figures straight off the shelf. Outsmart them with clever builds, silly synergies, and crafty plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/fffddf2a1ed0e8f3cc3299eb228a50d4.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/fffddf2a1ed0e8f3cc3299eb228a50d4.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Beyond battles, STACK\u2019EM! is filled with <strong>secrets, dares, and mysteries</strong>. Explore mystery rooms with quick playground minigames and hidden events. Win rare parts, odd trinkets, or uncover strange fusions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/6fdec19b9570066a7af38518114b3250.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/6fdec19b9570066a7af38518114b3250.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/6fdec19b9570066a7af38518114b3250.mp4?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 5.000.000 possible combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 items and trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 enemies to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and mysteries waiting to be found!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/9e83b1f6def163c675d0d70995e6b70f.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/9e83b1f6def163c675d0d70995e6b70f.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/9e83b1f6def163c675d0d70995e6b70f.mp4?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045580?t=1767807204","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/2c8e6626be0fa5a785394afd4516b93025c0a591/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767807204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/d5855af3bc6af57f2a5057e9543bd3af3eb68d5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767807204","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/d5855af3bc6af57f2a5057e9543bd3af3eb68d5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767807204","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STACK\u2019EM! is a tactical deckbuilder with a toybox twist: instead of shuffling cards, you stack body parts to build your own creatures out of cardboard, glue, and imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/2b7320210fb3c84e0d7894668c19afe5.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/2b7320210fb3c84e0d7894668c19afe5.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every arm, leg, head, or item you clip onto your stack changes its stats, abilities, and personality. The deeper the build, the stronger the creature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/bc96936a2ec2535a9530667b66f4e48c.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/bc96936a2ec2535a9530667b66f4e48c.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/bc96936a2ec2535a9530667b66f4e48c.mp4?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In STACK\u2019EM! there's no draw pile, no randomness. You always have your full deck in hand, and the only limit is your supply of clips, the resource you spend to stack\u2026 or unstack. Every decision matters, every turn is yours to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/e224b4cf201874b06fd8e6830e9f353b.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/e224b4cf201874b06fd8e6830e9f353b.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across the living room carpet against your friend\u2019s \u201cfactory-perfect\u201d toy creations: plastic mechas, porcelain dolls, plushies that bite back, and action figures straight off the shelf. Outsmart them with clever builds, silly synergies, and crafty plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/fffddf2a1ed0e8f3cc3299eb228a50d4.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/fffddf2a1ed0e8f3cc3299eb228a50d4.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Beyond battles, STACK\u2019EM! is filled with <strong>secrets, dares, and mysteries</strong>. Explore mystery rooms with quick playground minigames and hidden events. Win rare parts, odd trinkets, or uncover strange fusions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/6fdec19b9570066a7af38518114b3250.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/6fdec19b9570066a7af38518114b3250.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/6fdec19b9570066a7af38518114b3250.mp4?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 5.000.000 possible combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 items and trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 enemies to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and mysteries waiting to be found!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/9e83b1f6def163c675d0d70995e6b70f.poster.avif?t=1767807204\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/9e83b1f6def163c675d0d70995e6b70f.webm?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/extras/9e83b1f6def163c675d0d70995e6b70f.mp4?t=1767807204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Tunas' Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045580/bb6651a7b5850c1b82754d61288a8694cdb15a5e/header.jpg?t=1767807204","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045580/747088690/287a70620ed2e0e540c27b7b27737b7b67e50e46/1760951314/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760952292","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045580/747088690/287a70620ed2e0e540c27b7b27737b7b67e50e46/1760951314/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760952292","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045580/747088690/287a70620ed2e0e540c27b7b27737b7b67e50e46/1760951314/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760952292","id":257214432,"name":"STACK\u2019EM! (Official Teaser Trailer)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214432/d77130b12b18730f533fa81b26d7c43fced0a1ef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760952292"}],"name":"ST